codex
The nested design is now in place. For each outer fold, Phase 8 builds five inner chronological splits entirely inside that fold’s training prefix; feature selection is fitted on each inner training prefix, and Optuna chooses parameters solely from inner validation MAE. The outer validation rows are used once for evaluation and never for selection or tuning.

The strengthened two-trial perturbation test is currently running; it intentionally reruns the nested process twice, so it is substantially heavier than the earlier test.
