+Phase 8 repair attempt 2 - ML Agent implementation evidence
+Date: 2026-08-15 UTC
+
+Validator correction addressed
+- Attempt 1 reused a Phase 3 feature set selected through row 2659, contaminating
+  Phase 8 folds whose training prefixes ended earlier.
+- Attempt 1 artifacts remain preserved but are explicitly invalidated in STATUS.md.
+
+Implementation
+- experiments/phase8_cv_optuna.py loads all 40 Phase 2 candidates.
+- The approved deterministic Phase 3 selection method is fitted independently on
+  each outer-fold training prefix (635, 1268, 1901, 2534, and 3167 rows).
+- Fold-local selected features are used consistently by all Optuna trial/fold
+  evaluations, the linear-regression baseline, and frozen tuned candidates.
+- Naive lag-1 remains a direct simple baseline and uses no feature selection.
+- No full-data refit, external holdout access, or locked-test access occurred.
+
+Regression coverage
+- tests/test_phase8_cv_optuna.py perturbs all numeric candidate observations after
+  fold 1's training boundary, updates only the synthetic fixture provenance hash,
+  and reruns the experiment.
+- It proves fold-1 selected features, imputer statistics, scaler centers, Optuna
+  hyperparameters, and predictions on the same fixed validation probe are unchanged.
+
+Regenerated evidence
+- artifacts/phase8/phase8_attempt_2_20260815T235500Z/
+- 60 Optuna trials (20 for each of ridge, random forest, gradient boosting).
+- 3,165 out-of-fold prediction rows across five chronological folds.
+- 41 files total: five rankings, five selection reports, 20 fitted fold models,
+  trials, metrics, predictions, reports, plots, configuration, logs, and hashes.
+- artifact_hashes.json independently verified 40 SHA-256 entries.
+- Saved naive-lag-1 and linear-regression fold metrics independently recomputed.
+- Mean MAE: naive_lag_1 230.284394; linear_regression 303.248326; ridge
+  303.349151; random_forest 514.993063; gradient_boosting 534.884767.
+- Validation-only selected tuned candidate: ridge. No improvement claim made.
+
+Verification
+- PYTHONPATH=. pytest -q tests/test_phase8_cv_optuna.py
+  Result: 3 passed.
+- PYTHONPATH=. pytest -q
+  Result: 190 passed, 50 warnings in 61.87 seconds.
+- git diff --check
+  Result: PASS (no output).
+- Git status contained only the expected pre-existing Phase 8/STATUS scope.
+
+ML Agent review: implementation is ready for independent Validator review.
